sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Backend Service<br/>Client
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant API as Resource Server API

    Client->>AS: POST /token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials<br/>client authentication<br/>scope=fraud.check
    AS->>AS: Validate client identity<br/>and allowed scopes
    AS->>Client: access_token<br/>token represents the client
    Client->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    API->>API: Validate token<br/>issuer, audience, expiry, scope
    API->>Client: Protected response
